Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
	And these variables
		|portal.release|true|
		|portal.upstream|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Workflow|
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given TestCase set Up Portal Instance
	When User first Login PG
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Configuration
		|portlet|Workflow Configuration|
	And Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowResourceValue|Blogs Entry|
	And Workflow configure Workflow
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
		|workflowResourceValue|Message Boards Message|
	And Navigator open URL
	And ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Web Content|
	And Workflow configure Workflow Via Folder Info
		|workflowDefinition|Single Approver (Version 1)|
	And Page add
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	Then Portlet add PG
		|portletName|Asset Publisher|
Teardown: This executes after each scenario 
	Given PortalInstances tear Down CP
		|testPortalInstance|TestPropsUtil#get('test.portal.instance')|
Scenario: Approve Blogs Entry PG
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	When Blogs add With Workflow Via AP
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Blogs Entry|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And BlogsEntry view With Workflow PG Via AP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Blogs Entry|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And BlogsEntry view PG Via AP
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Submissions|
	And Workflow goto View Completed Asset Via My Submissions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	Then BlogsEntry view Entry As Workflow Asset
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
Scenario: Approve Message Boards Thread PG
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator open URL
	When ProductMenu goto Sites Content
		|portlet|Message Boards|
	And MessageboardsThread add With Workflow CP
		|threadBody|MB Thread Message Body|
		|threadSubject|MB Thread Message Subject|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|MB Thread Message Subject|
		|workflowAssetType|Message Boards Message|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And MessageboardsThread view With Workflow PG Via AP
		|threadSubject|MB Thread Message Subject|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|MB Thread Message Subject|
		|workflowAssetType|Message Boards Message|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	Then MessageboardsThread view PG Via AP
		|threadBody|MB Thread Message Body|
		|threadSubject|MB Thread Message Subject|
Scenario: Approve Web Content PG
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	When WebContent add With Workflow PG Via AP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|WC WebContent Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Web Content Article|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And WebContent view With Workflow PG Via AP
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow approve Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|WC WebContent Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Web Content Article|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	Then WebContent view PG Via AP
		|webContentContent|WC WebContent Content|
		|webContentTitle|WC WebContent Title|
Scenario: Reject Blogs Entry PG
Priority: 4
	Given Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	When Blogs add With Workflow Via AP
		|entryContent|Blogs Entry Content|
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow assign To Me Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Blogs Entry|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	And BlogsEntry view With Workflow PG Via AP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow reject Task By Actions
		|workflowAssetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Blogs Entry|
		|workflowTask|Review|
	And Page goto My Account
		|portletName|My Workflow Tasks|
	And Workflow view Rejected Task
		|workflowAssetTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|workflowAssetType|Blogs Entry|
	And Navigator goto Page
		|pageName|Asset Publisher Page|
	Then BlogsEntry view With Workflow PG Via AP
		|entryTitle|Blogs Entry Title|
		|webContentTitle|Blogs Entry Title|

